# Targets the security-audit govulncheck job scans for this module.
# Format: GOOS GOARCH CGO_ENABLED ./pattern [./pattern ...]
# Mirrors what build-installers.yml ships: every Windows binary (agent,
# watchdog, bootstrap, desktop, desktop-helper; installer via build.ps1),
# and agent/watchdog/bootstrap for linux and darwin, all with CGO_ENABLED=0.
# The cgo X11/PulseAudio desktop code under internal/ is not part of any
# linux/darwin binary that ships, so it is not a target here.
windows amd64 0 ./...
windows arm64 0 ./...
linux amd64 0 ./cmd/sentinel-agent ./cmd/sentinel-watchdog ./cmd/sentinel-bootstrap
linux arm64 0 ./cmd/sentinel-agent ./cmd/sentinel-watchdog ./cmd/sentinel-bootstrap
darwin amd64 0 ./cmd/sentinel-agent ./cmd/sentinel-watchdog ./cmd/sentinel-bootstrap
darwin arm64 0 ./cmd/sentinel-agent ./cmd/sentinel-watchdog ./cmd/sentinel-bootstrap
